all right now,free,blues,0,"There she stood in the street    Smiling from her head to her feet    I said ""Hey, what is this""    Now baby, maybe she's in need of a kiss    I said ""Hey, what's your name baby""    Maybe we can see things the same    Now don't you wait or hesitate    Let's move before they raise the parking rate        All right now baby, it's all right now    All right now baby, it's all right now        I took her home to my place    Watching every move on her face    She said ""Look, what's your game baby    Are you tryin' to put me in shame?""    I said ""slow don't go so fast,    Don't you think that love can last?""    She said "" Love, Lord above,    Now you're tryin' to trick me in love""        All right now baby, it's all right now    All right now baby, it's all right now    "
