i can't get you off my mind,hank williams,honky-tonk,16,"I can't get you off of my mind    When I try, I'm just wastin' my time    Lord, I've tried and I've tried and all night long I've cried    But I can't get you off of my mind    Well, you think you would leave me behind    But I guess you're the good timin' kind    Do you think that it's smart to jump from heart to heart    When I can't get you off of my mind    I can't get you off of my mind    When I try, I'm just wastin' my time    Lord, I've tried and I've tried and all night long I've cried    But I can't get you off of my mind    You believe that a true love is blind    So you fool every new love you find    You've got stars in your eyes, but they can't hide the lies    I can't get you off of my mind    I can't get you off of my mind    When I try, I'm just wastin' my time    Lord, I've tried and I've tried and all night long I've cried    But I can't get you off of my mind      "
